Create systems for:

Annual Form 990-series filing, as applicable

State annual reports

Charitable-registration renewals

Payroll tax filings, if applicable

Grant reports

Donation records

Donor acknowledgments

Records retention

Public disclosure requirements

For U.S. charitable contributions of $250 or more, donors generally need a contemporaneous written acknowledgment to substantiate a deduction. 
